<overview>
<p>Light rifle platoons arm their troops with Zeus heavy rifles and light SRM launchers, combining heavier personal weapons with disposable anti-armor capability. The Zeus rifles deliver greater stopping power than standard assault rifles at the cost of additional weight and recoil, while the light SRM launchers give the platoon a limited anti-vehicle option without the bulk of full-sized missile systems.</p>
</overview>

